   "texto": "shooting top performing agents,"
  },
  {
   "s": 9.82,
   "e": 10.88,
   "texto": "but I shut that down anyway."
  },
  {
   "s": 11.4,
   "e": 12.06,
   "texto": "The money was good,"
  },
  {
   "s": 12.24,
   "e": 14.8,
   "texto": "but every dollar depended on me getting on the next flight."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.98,
   "e": 16.74,
   "texto": "And if I stopped flying, started the income."
  },
  {
   "s": 17.12,
   "e": 18.78,
   "texto": "And if we're being real, that isn't a business."
  },
  {
   "s": 19.08,
   "e": 20.68,
   "texto": "It's an expensive job with a camera."
  },
  {
   "s": 21.0,
   "e": 23.26,
   "texto": "I started Listwell to prove the opposite as possible."
  },
  {
   "s": 23.46,
   "e": 24.92,
   "texto": "A real estate media company that scales"
  },
  {
   "s": 24.92,
   "e": 27.44,
   "texto": "and keeps running even when the owner isn't in it."
  },
  {
   "s": 27.56,
   "e": 29.28,
   "texto": "The goal was never a bigger media company."
  },
  {
   "s": 29.28,
   "e": 31.0,
   "texto": "It was one that runs when I'm not in it."
  },
  {
   "s": 31.2,
   "e": 32.94,
   "texto": "And I'm going to teach you exactly how I do it."
  },
  {
   "s": 33.18,
   "e": 34.74,
   "texto": "But this isn't for someone who just bought a camera."
  },
  {
   "s": 34.96,
